{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["You shall not give me anything — of all the flocks you have now, since I served you for your daughters; but from what your flocks breed from now onward, give me the streaked and the spotted, and those streaked and spotted that are now in your flocks — remove them from there and give them into the hand of your sons, to separate them from those that will be born from now on, which are to be my wages."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:45.772032872Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}